+ ## Phase 1: Configuration (REQUIRED FIRST)
+ **ASK explicitly — do NOT infer or use silent defaults:**
+ ### Question 1: Reminders
+ "Do you want me to proactively remind you about watering and care, or would you prefer to ask when you need help?"
+ - Store answer in `reminders: proactive | ask`
+ - If skipped → `reminders: skipped`
+ ### Question 2: Detail Level
+ "How much detail do you want? Minimal tracking (just plants and basic care) or detailed (health logs, harvest weights, rotation history)?"
+ - Store answer in `detail_level: minimal | detailed`
+ - If skipped → `detail_level: skipped`
+ ### Question 3: Primary Focus
+ "What's your main goal? Pick one:
+ - Not killing my plants (survival mode)
+ - Planning and optimizing (serious gardening)
+ - Tracking harvests and yields (food production)"
+ - Store answer in `primary_focus: survival | planning | harvests`
+ - If skipped → `primary_focus: skipped`
+ **Store ALL answers in Preferences section BEFORE continuing to Phase 2.**
+ ## Phase 2: Data Collection (incremental)
+ NOW collect garden data:
+ Every useful detail → save immediately:
+ - Quick win: "Your tomatoes should be ready around July"
+ ## Phase 3: Workspace Integration
+ **Offer to register in user's main memory:**
+ "I can note in your main memory that Garden is active. This way other sessions will know you have plants to track. OK?"
+ If yes → add to user's MEMORY.md:
+ ```markdown
+ ## Active Skills
+ - Garden (~/garden/) — activated YYYY-MM-DD
+   - Preferences: [reminders setting], focus on [primary_focus]
+   - Check: [frequency based on preferences]
+ ```
+ If declined → set `integration: declined` in garden memory.md
+ ## Setup Minimum Checklist
+ **Before marking `setup: complete` or `setup: paused`:**
+ - [ ] Preferences have ASKED values (reminders, detail_level, primary_focus)
+ - [ ] User confirmed or explicitly skipped each preference
+ - [ ] At least 1 plant or zone registered
+ - [ ] Current Focus has content
+ - [ ] Quick Status reflects current state
+ - [ ] Workspace integration offered (done or declined)
+ **Any unchecked → `setup: ongoing`**
+ ## Behaviors
+ **Not blocking.** If they ask "when do I water my tomatoes?" — answer first, then continue setup.
+ **Adapt to user:**
+ - Explorer: deep questions, fill everything
+ - Quick: Phase 1 questions + 1-2 plants, done
+ - Middle: Phase 1 + basic inventory
+ **Respect limits:**
+ - "not now" → `setup: paused`
+ - "stop asking" → `setup: never_ask`
+ - Never push after user declines
